# ============================================================
# BLACKOUT Backend — Local Configuration Template
# ============================================================
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (same directory) and fill in
# your own values.
#
# `wrangler dev` reads `.dev.vars` automatically for local secrets.
# `npm run deploy` uses `dotenv-cli` to load these values for
# `${D1_DATABASE_ID}` interpolation in `wrangler.jsonc`.
#
# .dev.vars is gitignored — never commit it.
# ============================================================

# --- NOWPayments ---
# Get them from https://account.nowpayments.io/store-settings
NOWPAYMENTS_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
NOWPAYMENTS_IPN_SECRET=your_ipn_secret_here

# --- Admin Panel ---
# Choose a very strong password (20+ chars, mix of letters,
# digits, and symbols)
ADMIN_SECRET=your_super_strong_admin_password_here